<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Far-Ben lowered to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Far-Ben lowered to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Abaco/Rodman brokerage lowered its recommendation of Far-Ben to hold from buy, the brokerage said Wednesday in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Luis Miranda cited sluggish sales at the end of 1996, and he revised 1996 earning estimates down to 1.131 pesos per share from 1.293 pesos.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were up 4 centavos at 17.20 pesos midday.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
